---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, SITE_OWNER } from '../consts';
---

<Layout
	title="About Smart Pick"
	description="Smart Pick shares practical guides and honest product picks to help you choose with confidence."
	pubDate={new Date('2026-10-03')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
	affiliate={false}
>
	<p>
		Welcome to {SITE_OWNER}! There are thousands of programs, guides, and products online, and most
		of them promise the same thing. It is hard to know what is actually worth your time and money.
		That is why this site exists.
	</p>

	<h2>What you will find here</h2>
	<p>
		{SITE_OWNER} publishes practical, easy-to-follow articles. We started with health and fitness:
		home workouts, healthy eating, and building better daily habits. Over time we are adding more
		topics, such as self-improvement, home and garden, cooking, and more.
	</p>
	<p>Every post aims to do three things:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Explain the problem clearly, without hype.</li>
		<li>Give you useful tips you can use right away, even if you never buy anything.</li>
		<li>Point you to products that can help, and be honest about who they are and are not for.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>How we choose products</h2>
	<p>
		We look at what a product actually includes, who it is designed for, what other buyers say, and
		whether it comes with a fair refund policy. If something makes unrealistic promises, we do not
		recommend it.
	</p>

	<h2>How this site makes money</h2>
	<p>
		Some links on {SITE_OWNER} are affiliate links. If you click one and make a purchase, we may earn
		a commission at no extra cost to you. This helps keep the site running and the content free. It
		never changes the price you pay, and it does not decide what we write about.
	</p>

	<h2>A note on health content</h2>
	<p>
		Our health and fitness articles are for general information only and are not medical advice. We
		are not doctors. Please talk to a qualified healthcare professional before starting any new
		diet, supplement, or exercise program, especially if you have a medical condition.
	</p>

	<h2>Get in touch</h2>
	<p>
		Have a question, a suggestion, or a topic you would like us to cover? Email us at
		<a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. We read every message.
	</p>
</Layout>
